# ---- Generated assets (regenerated from ~/code/Illutia via tools/AssetConverter) ----
# Everything under Assets/ is derived output (decoded spritesheets, per-id SpriteFrames
# .tres, Maps, and the AnimationHeights/AnimationToFirstFrame metadata). Regenerate with
# `dotnet run --project tools/AssetConverter/src/AssetConverter -- batch`. Drop this line
# if you later decide to commit them for reproducible builds without the source data.
/Assets/

